{"data": [{"author_id": "369869874", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118501115709006201"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 21, "start": 18, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 132, "start": 126, "tag": "India"}], "mentions": [{"end": 226, "id": "719200613", "start": 217, "username": "Rudra_81"}], "urls": [{"description": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "display_url": "or-f.org/40560", "end": 250, "expanded_url": "https://or-f.org/40560", "images": [{"height": 613, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118976800277594112/MwrS_O9j?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 871}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118976800277594112/MwrS_O9j?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 227, "status": 200, "title": "India Must Urgently Build Its Own AI Safety Institute", "unwound_url": "https://www.orfonline.org/research/india-must-urgently-build-its-own-ai-safety-institute", "url": "https://t.co/dKEyvqLuEd"}]}, "id": "2118501115709006201", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 39, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "The next phase of #AI competition will not only be about building powerful models, but also about governing them responsibly. #India needs an AI Safety Institute that can set benchmarks relevant for the Global South: @Rudra_81 https://t.co/dKEyvqLuEd", "url": "https://x.com/ORFMumbai/status/2118501115709006201"}, {"author_id": "484468243", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:25:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118454594909208601"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/gUnPpupQt9", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SpectatorOz/status/2118454594909208601/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118454434103762944", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/gUnPpupQt9"}]}, "id": "2118454594909208601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 289, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "A bad night for Silicon Valley, though, could potentially be good news for Britain. Under first Rishi Sunak and then Keir Starmer, Whitehall has adopted a relatively enlightened attitude towards regulation, pioneering the AI Safety Institute model. With the UK now boasting the https://t.co/gUnPpupQt9", "url": "https://x.com/SpectatorOz/status/2118454594909208601"}, {"author_id": "453473029", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:40:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118473633769373809", "2118473683844976785"], "id": "2118473633769373809", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 468, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I don't think you will long be able to describe a country that is looking to regulatorily align with the *european union* as world leading in any aspect of AI.\n\nBritain has missed the boat on sovereign frontier models but is not as far behind as Europe. London is at least second", "url": "https://x.com/tomhfh/status/2118473633769373809"}, {"author_id": "453473029", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:41:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118473633769373809", "2118473683844976785"], "id": "2118473683844976785", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 27, "impression_count": 14725, "like_count": 317, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 50}, "text": "I don't think you will long be able to describe a country that is looking to regulatorily align with the *european union* as world leading in any aspect of AI.\n\nBritain has missed the boat on sovereign frontier models but is not as far behind as Europe. London is at least second", "url": "https://x.com/tomhfh/status/2118473683844976785"}, {"author_id": "2013613489798160388", "created_at": "2026-11-07T03:02:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118902003472503288"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/waYOzeXfVH", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2118902003472503288/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118901781560184832", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/waYOzeXfVH"}, {"display_url": "x.com/robocurve/stat…", "end": 325, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/robocurve/status/2118791723606593694", "start": 302, "url": "https://t.co/GlTDr2XKkd"}]}, "id": "2118902003472503288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9686, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 3, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118791723606593694", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Robocurve just showed that tampered video can trick every frontier AI model it tested into harmful robot actions today. Here's what you need to know.\n\nRobocurve PBC posted a study called \"You Can't See Everything: Perceptual Attacks on Embodied AI.\" It says video tampering can https://t.co/waYOzeXfVH https://t.co/GlTDr2XKkd", "url": "https://x.com/AGTPinsights/status/2118902003472503288"}, {"author_id": "1935643230152077313", "created_at": "2026-11-07T08:13:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118980029073735742"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 183, "start": 180, "tag": "AI"}, {"end": 197, "start": 184, "tag": "GenerativeAI"}, {"end": 209, "start": 198, "tag": "FrontierAI"}], "urls": [{"description": "The article explains how developers can use Frontier AI agents to move ideas into testable virtual environments. It highlights the potential to speed up design evaluation and reduce costs through simulations.", "display_url": "ai-news.page/news/baf7193e7…", "end": 179, "expanded_url": "https://ai-news.page/news/baf7193e75c14529/", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118980036334149633/6_GOMjHj?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118980036334149633/6_GOMjHj?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 156, "status": 200, "title": "Virtualize Design with Frontier AI Agents", "unwound_url": "https://ai-news.page/news/baf7193e75c14529/", "url": "https:/